I am at the office.
I am working at my desk.
Priya comes to my desk.
She asks me, "Maya, are you free for a little while?"
I say, "Yes Priya, tell me."
Priya smiles and says, "I am inviting you to my house for dinner this Saturday."
I am very happy to hear this.
I think that this is a very nice idea.
I say to her, "Thank you Priya, I will definitely come."
Priya says, "I will cook some special Maharashtrian dishes for you."
I say with excitement, "Wow, I will like that very much!"
Priya says, "Let's eat together and chat a lot."
I say, "Yes, definitely."
She gives me her home address.
I tell her, "I will reach there at seven o'clock on Saturday evening."
She says, "Alright, let's meet on Saturday!"
Priya goes back to her desk.
I am now waiting for Saturday.
